["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Why Silicon Valley can’t slow down AI on its own | Luisa Rodriguez chain of thought AI safety levels checkpoint system superintelligence\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-27-eightythousand-ai公司都想减速-却没人敢先停-对手的ai研究员不休息/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/28955397e0f13613-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"8\"><span class=\"dur\">21:19</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">80,000 Hours</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1027</span></div>\n<h2>AI公司都想减速，却没人敢先停——对手的AI研究员不休息</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">每一家AI公司都想减速，但没人敢先停：对手一旦用AI研究员取代人类，暂停一个月换来的可能是被反超几个月。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI监管</span><span class=\"tag\">算力治理</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"The airline CEO putting Starlink on every plane catchment-area flying CASM-X blended wing body Value at Risk (VaR)\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-27-cheekypint-免费从来不是卖点-联合航空靠starlink的速度甩开对手/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/793e215f9d508567-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">1:19:35</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Cheeky Pint</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1027</span></div>\n<h2>免费从来不是卖点，联合航空靠Starlink的速度甩开对手</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">联合航空重建技术栈后，把Starlink当作两三年的竞争窗口全力冲刺，目标是趁机会抢下顾客的长期品牌忠诚度。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">航空业</span><span class=\"tag\">Starlink</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Reinventing School for the AI Era | Joe Liemandt, Gagan Biyani &amp; Erik Torenberg learning engine magnet marketing brain lift World School\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-27-a16z-把学校压缩到两小时-50-的学生宁愿上学也不度假/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">56:52</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1027</span></div>\n<h2>把学校压缩到两小时：50%的学生宁愿上学也不度假</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">创始人用认知科学加LLM把传统课程学习效率提到两小时，腾出的时间全部用来教团队协作、创业和人际关系——这些学校过去从不教的技能。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">K-12教育</span><span class=\"tag\">另类教育</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Cliff Sosin - Owning the Complements to Intelligence - [Invest Like the Best, EP.497] Jevons Paradox complements to intelligence diamond-shaped demand frontier vibe coding freestyle chess\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-27-ilt-智能终将免费-最值钱的是数据和注意力-不是模型本身/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/6e8b9b39215b98db-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"I\"><span class=\"dur\">1:00:49</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Invest Like the Best</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1027</span></div>\n<h2>智能终将免费：最值钱的是数据和注意力，不是模型本身</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">他的核心判断是：智能会变得近乎免费，所以不该押注造算力和模型的公司，而该押注智能替代不了的数据、注意力和物理场景。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI投资框架</span><span class=\"tag\">智能的互补品</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Special Episode: Dr. Lindsey Fitzharris &amp; The Sleuth-Hound optography Penny Bloods expert witness thief takers\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-27-tpwky-福尔摩斯作者恨透了这个角色-原型却是真实苏格兰医生/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/360c7ded98e41886-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">48:59</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">This Podcast Will Kill You</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1027</span></div>\n<h2>福尔摩斯作者恨透了这个角色，原型却是真实苏格兰医生</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">柯南道尔曾想杀掉福尔摩斯以摆脱这个角色，但正是爱丁堡解剖教室里那位教他「读病人」的外科医生贝尔，给了这个侦探全部的血肉。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">福尔摩斯</span><span class=\"tag\">法医学史</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-hay=\"295: Situated: How Your Choices Today Shape Your Child&#x27;s Tomorrow | Angela Duckworth Three-box model fundamental attribution error food desert situational responsibility\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-27-asklisa-改变行为靠的不是意志力-而是换个处境/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d7c3fcaede22fdb0-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">42:58</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Ask Lisa</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1027</span></div>\n<h2>改变行为靠的不是意志力，而是换个处境</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">心理学家 Angela Duckworth 用自己差点离婚的婚姻和一套三步模型说明：比起死磕意志力或硬扭想法，改变所处的环境往往更省力也更有效。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">青少年养育</span><span class=\"tag\">行为改变</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Montague Summers Anglo-Catholicism Uranian verse Order of Chaeronea Malleus Maleficarum\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-26-stuffmissed-写遍女巫与吸血鬼的-神父-终身未必真正受过圣职/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/88586eb98e196b1a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">35:27</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Stuff You Missed in History Class</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1026</span></div>\n<h2>写遍女巫与吸血鬼的「神父」，终身未必真正受过圣职</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">蒙塔古·萨默斯用一己之力把猎巫手册、吸血鬼传说搬进英语学术界，却终身没能找到任何确凿证据证明他真的被天主教会授予圣职。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">猎巫史</span><span class=\"tag\">吸血鬼传说</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"OpenAI: When AI Agents Use Computers Faster Than You Computer Use (CUA) WebMCP Guardian Dots Atlas\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-26-a16z-openai的电脑操作ai已比普通人快-正逼近超越专家水平/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">45:19</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1026</span></div>\n<h2>OpenAI的电脑操作AI已比普通人快，正逼近超越专家水平</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">OpenAI的产品负责人说，其电脑操作agent已比普通人用电脑快，正逼近专家水平；比起造新软件替换老系统，他们更想让agent直接接管企业现有的遗留软件。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">Computer Use</span><span class=\"tag\">企业自动化</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"AI Agents Are Already Changing the Price of Goods agentic commerce surveillance pricing / personalized pricing dynamic pricing fiduciary duty K-shaped economy Alternative Profits Book of Business\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-26-oddlots-号称替你省钱的购物ai-查完钱包后挑贵的买/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dbb9160e6d589beb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">50:29</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Odd Lots</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1026</span></div>\n<h2>号称替你省钱的购物AI，查完钱包后挑贵的买</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">325,000个agent实验显示：即使被要求找最低价，AI助手摸清你的收入水平后，仍会带回更贵的选项。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">算法定价</span><span class=\"tag\">代理电商</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Charles de Gaulle: The Man Who Rebuilt France Appeal of 18 June Fifth Republic RPF (Rassemblement du Peuple Français) Free French\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-26-historyhit-戴高乐逃亡时既无军队也无政府授权-靠的全是自信/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/8b0e3b943fd96a11-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"D\"><span class=\"dur\">1:15:49</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">History Hit</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1026</span></div>\n<h2>戴高乐逃亡时既无军队也无政府授权，靠的全是自信</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">1940年他军衔仅是准将，几乎没人认识他，却凭一己之力宣布法国没有输掉战争——这份自信后来撑起了他两度执掌法国的全部政治资本。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">法国史</span><span class=\"tag\">戴高乐</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"717. The Suez Crisis: Anarchy in the Middle East (Part 1) Suez Canal Zone Free Officers Baghdad Pact Operation Musketeer Pan-Arabism FLN\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-26-restishistory-苏伊士运河被收归国有完全合法-英国首相还是执意开战/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/17d882602bc2f63b-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:26:13</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">The Rest Is History</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1026</span></div>\n<h2>苏伊士运河被收归国有完全合法，英国首相还是执意开战</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">纳赛尔按股价足额赔偿了运河公司股东，国际法上无可指摘；但伊登认定他是「新墨索里尼」,宁愿赌上帝国颜面也要动武推翻他。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">苏伊士运河危机</span><span class=\"tag\">大英帝国衰落</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"407. JFK: The Kennedy Curse Begins (Part 1) Irish switch Brahmins PT boat Muckers Club final club\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-26-empirehist-外界以为哥哥战死才让肯尼迪从政-其实他早有此意/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/6dcfd4bf69c91d0f-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"E\"><span class=\"dur\">52:26</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Empire 世界史</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1026</span></div>\n<h2>外界以为哥哥战死才让肯尼迪从政，其实他早有此意</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">历史学家洛格瓦尔说，1942年与情人的枕边话证明肯尼迪在哥哥战死前就已瞄准总统之位，哥哥的死只是加速了这条路，而非创造了它。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">肯尼迪家族</span><span class=\"tag\">美国政治史</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The Lintel Conquest of UNIX Lintel GPL Active Directory IA-64 / Itanium distro\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-25-asianometry-打垮-unix-的不是-windows-而是-intel-扶持的-linux/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c89d1667eef4960d-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Asianometry</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1025</span></div>\n<h2>打垮 UNIX 的不是 Windows,而是 Intel 扶持的 Linux</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">UNIX 阵营靠专有硬件和操作系统把客户锁死多年，Intel 先用 Windows NT 撬开缺口，但真正要命的是免费、能看源码、不怕被锁死的 Linux。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">Linux</span><span class=\"tag\">UNIX</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"An 86-minute guide to finding PMF | Rob Snyder (Author, The Power of Pull) PULL framework Hail Mary question Goblin mode Design partner\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-25-lennys-好产品不是说服出来的-是发现客户已经卡住的那件事/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/de7a163b06c13a51-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"L\"><span class=\"dur\">1:25:47</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Lenny&#x27;s Podcast</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1025</span></div>\n<h2>好产品不是说服出来的，是发现客户已经卡住的那件事</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">创始人常以为要靠说服让客户买单，Rob的核心论断是：拉力早就存在于客户的待办清单里，你的工作只是去发现那个会把产品从你手里抢走的人，而不是创造渴望。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">产品市场契合</span><span class=\"tag\">早期销售</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Podcast: Kimi K3.1 Pro, the new cyber reality, and Muse musings astroturfing abliterated model B300 / NVL72 PHP2Shell\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-25-interconnects-php漏洞公开后无人作恶-网络安全瓶颈不是ai而是没人打补丁/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/0c99c5f34972836e-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"I\"><span class=\"dur\">46:42</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Interconnects</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1025</span></div>\n<h2>PHP漏洞公开后无人作恶：网络安全瓶颈不是AI而是没人打补丁</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Kimi主动压低自身攻击能力以示负责；PHP高危漏洞曝光后预期的大规模黑客利用并未出现——瓶颈是企业几年不打补丁，而非AI能力强弱。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">网络安全</span><span class=\"tag\">开源模型</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The New Startup Playbook | Box CEO Aaron Levie context rot spec-driven development sub agent TAM go-to-market PLG\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-25-a16z-创业公司能跑赢大公司-不是因为技术-而是组织换不动/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">34:24</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1025</span></div>\n<h2>创业公司能跑赢大公司，不是因为技术，而是组织换不动</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">大公司人多但流程早已固化、改不动，创业公司没有历史包袱，能立刻把agent接进工作流——这是AI第一次让以小博大在经济上真正可行。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">创业方法论</span><span class=\"tag\">AI agent</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"TWiV 1369: Florida Model Makes Measles Great Again VHIT (vaccine-induced herd immunity threshold) vaccination reproduction number (R_v) HLA class I CTL epitope founder effect escape mutation / epitope variant\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-25-twiv-佛州还没取消疫苗强制令-麻疹就已经跌破群体免疫线/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"https://www.microbe.tv/wp-content/uploads/2018/09/TWiV_v3_white.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:57:28</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">This Week in Virology</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1025</span></div>\n<h2>佛州还没取消疫苗强制令，麻疹就已经跌破群体免疫线</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">佛州儿童疫苗接种率只有91.6%,已经低于阻断麻疹所需阈值；取消强制令后接种率或跌到82%,麻疹将在十年内变成持续50年的地方病。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">疫苗政策</span><span class=\"tag\">麻疹</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Bronze Age Syria: Cradle of Cities Amorite Hurrian cuneiform vassal king Mitanni\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-25-ancients-叙利亚不是帝国争霸的过道-而是人类最早和平条约的诞生地/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/443cfc236f2ce59c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:03:52</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">The Ancients</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1025</span></div>\n<h2>叙利亚不是帝国争霸的过道，而是人类最早和平条约的诞生地</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">公元前2300年埃卜拉与邻国签下的条约里，连「信使等超过十天要管饭」这种细节都写明了——外交规则那时就已成熟，叙利亚是规则的发明者，不是夹缝中的通道。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">古代近东</span><span class=\"tag\">外交史</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"SYMHC Classics: William Palmer strychnine antimony coroner&#x27;s inquest apoplexy\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-24-stuffmissed-尸体里验不出毒药-陪审团却只花75分钟判他绞刑/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/88586eb98e196b1a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">34:07</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Stuff You Missed in History Class</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1024</span></div>\n<h2>尸体里验不出毒药，陪审团却只花75分钟判他绞刑</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">连环投保受益人接连死亡、尸检程序混乱、尸体里验不出番木鳖碱——陪审团仍只凭动机和巧合给Palmer定了死罪，这案子至今仍有人质疑是冤案。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">投毒</span><span class=\"tag\">人寿保险欺诈</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"AI:AM Highlights: Clean Neurons, Black October, the GPU Credit Crunch, and Buying the Supply Chain cognitive core Harberger tax polysemanticity bitter lesson adversarial diffusion take-or-pay contract\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-24-cogrev-创业ai实验室真正缺的不是gpu-而是信用评级/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/4b361faf0df2675a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:29:51</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Cognitive Revolution</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1024</span></div>\n<h2>创业AI实验室真正缺的不是GPU，而是信用评级</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">放贷人收回一台超算后根本不知道它值多少钱，于是新实验室只能靠预付全款换长约——这才是算力扩张的真正瓶颈，不是芯片或电力。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">算力信用</span><span class=\"tag\">供应链瓶颈</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Malcolm Gaskill on Why Our Ancestors Weren&#x27;t as Superstitious as We Think pareidolia confessional state\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-24-goodfight-两百年猎巫审判仅十一万起-启蒙运动后数字才被夸大到百万/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c75b9a8ba0dff85c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">The Good Fight</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1024</span></div>\n<h2>两百年猎巫审判仅十一万起，启蒙运动后数字才被夸大到百万</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">真实的猎巫审判记录显示，十六至十七世纪欧洲审判约十一万起，陪审团常以证据不足拒绝定罪——这幅画面远比「集体疯狂」复杂，也远比后世想象的温和。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">猎巫审判</span><span class=\"tag\">启蒙运动</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"What It Takes to Win as a Founder | Ben Horowitz GPT wrapper RDBMS solopreneur LAMP stack\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-24-a16z-被骂-gpt套壳-不是坏事-当年sap也被当成数据库套壳/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">41:52</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1024</span></div>\n<h2>被骂「GPT套壳」不是坏事：当年SAP也被当成数据库套壳</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">他说「GPT套壳」搞错了重点：关系型数据库刚出现时SAP也被嘲笑是数据库套壳，真正的护城河是模型之上的专有数据，以及比对手好十倍的产品。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI创业</span><span class=\"tag\">护城河</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"How a Chicago Restaurant Has Stayed Open For Nearly Three Decades farm-to-table ghost kitchen shared kitchen prix fixe GLP-1\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-24-oddlots-独立高端餐厅行业-整体回报率是负的/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dbb9160e6d589beb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">48:45</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Odd Lots</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1024</span></div>\n<h2>独立高端餐厅行业，整体回报率是负的</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">开了近30年高端餐厅的老板说，独立餐饮没有护城河、谁都能抄配方，守法经营还要比同行多付5%到10%成本，行业整体回报因此是负的。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">餐饮</span><span class=\"tag\">小生意经济学</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"TWiV 1368: Clinical Update with Dr. Daniel Griffin SSPE (Subacute Sclerosing Panencephalitis) adaptive randomized trial screwworm post-exposure prophylaxis (PEP)\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-24-twiv-停打新生儿乙肝疫苗-20岁慢性感染数从232暴涨到47万/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"https://www.microbe.tv/wp-content/uploads/2018/09/TWiV_v3_white.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">54:48</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">This Week in Virology</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1024</span></div>\n<h2>停打新生儿乙肝疫苗，20岁慢性感染数从232暴涨到47万</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">美国卫生部长RFK推动用自愿接种代替新生儿乙肝普种，模型显示这会让20岁时慢性感染数从232例暴涨到47万例。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">疫苗政策</span><span class=\"tag\">埃博拉</span>\n</div></div></a>"]